libstdc++ 13's <format>: the four inline std::vformat overloads
(format:3784/3793/3802/3811) were dropped with "scope '__format' is
ambiguous" -- see test.desc (header-free, CORE).  That is fixed, and so is
the later format:1422 drop (cpp11_libstdcxx_header_drops/
test_format.desc).  Remaining: format:3124 basic_format_arg::_M_visit, the
same drop as test_format.desc.  g++ 13 accepts this program, and it fails
only its WRONG assertion.
